# Prettier owns the JS side of the monorepo (GUARDRAILS 10, gate 1): js/, the workbench's
# TypeScript and the root JS and JSON config. The rest has another owner and stays out:
# Pint formats PHP, Composer writes its JSON with four spaces, the compose and Testbench YAML
# belong to the PHP toolchain, and the Markdown guides and PROGRESS.md are written by hand and
# by the agent harness. The fixture addon's prebuilt panel bundle is built output, signed as it
# is, so a formatter never touches it.
/vendor/
/.claude/
/.harness/
/packages/
/docker/
/composer.json
/composer.lock
/pint.json
/compose.yaml
/testbench.yaml
*.md
/workbench/addons/*/dist/
